.TH "libnvmf_params_free" 9 "libnvmf_params_free" "October 2026" "libnvme API manual" LINUX
.SH NAME
libnvmf_params_free \- Free a connection parameter set.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B "void" libnvmf_params_free
.BI "(struct libnvmf_params *params "  ");"
.SH ARGUMENTS
.IP "params" 12
Parameter set to free. NULL is ignored.
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
Only free a set obtained from \fBlibnvmf_params_new\fP; never call this on
a set borrowed from a configuration.
